{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1498506-phrases-for-the-exarchs","id":1498506,"title":"Phrases For The Exarchs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-01T00:34:12-08:00","id":1498506,"title":"Phrases For The Exarchs","content":"<u>Raptor:</u> <i>APPETITE BEFORE REASON. YOU MUST FEED TO THRIVE.</i> <b>[YOU ARE A PUPPET OF GENETICS AND A SLAVE OF INSTINCTS.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Prophet:</u> <i>FOLLOW THE CHAMPIONS. EVERYTHING HAPPENS AS IT MUST.</i> <b>[YOU ARE DUST BENEATH THE BOOTS OF HISTORY.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>General:</u> <i>FIGHT FOR GLORY. TO WAR IS HUMAN.</i> <b>[YOU ARE A NAMELESS CORPSE FIT ONLY FOR ADORNING TRENCHES.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Eye:</u> <i>ALWAYS PAY ATTENTION. YOU MUST REMAIN VIGILANT.</i> <b>[YOU ARE NAKED BEFORE THE JUDGMENT OF OTHERS.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Unity:</u> <i>MAINTAIN YOURSELF FOCUSED. DO NOT LEAVE YOUR IDENTITY UNGUARDED.</i> <b>[THEY ARE MOCKERIES OF NORMALCY.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Father:</u> <i>SAFETY IN CONVICTION. THE LOST MUST RECEIVE GUIDANCE.</i> <b>[HERETICS ARE BENEATH YOUR CONSIDERATION.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Ruin:</u> <i>UNCERTAINTY IS TREACHEROUS. ACCEPT THE IMMUTABLE.</i> <b>[ALL HAS BEEN PREDETERMINED AND LEADS TO FAILURE.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Nemesis:</u> <i>CURIOSITY BEGETS ERROR. UNDERSTAND ONLY WHAT IS CRUCIAL.</i> <b>[SEEK NOT ANSWERS AND KNEEL IN DARKNESS.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Chancellor:</u> <i>PROTECT YOUR RESOURCES. THERE IS NOT ENOUGH FOR EVERYBODY.</i> <b>[TAKE EVERYTHING AND GIVE NOTHING.]</b><br /> <br /> <u>Psychopomp:</u> <i>MAKE SAFE CHOICES. YOUR DEEDS WILL BE MEASURED AFTER DEATH.</i> <b>[THERE IS NO LEGACY, ONLY REGRET.]</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T01:07:07-08:00","id":1498509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1498506-phrases-for-the-exarchs#post1498506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Psychopomp:</u> <i>MAKE SAFE CHOICES. YOUR DEEDS WILL BE MEASURED AFTER DEATH.</i> <b>[THERE IS NO LEGACY, ONLY REGRET.]</b></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Fuck you! Just for that, I'm going to make a Legacy about Legacies!&quot; -Impulsive Free Council historian.<br /> <br /> &quot;What am I, chopped liver?&quot; - Stone Scribe","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Me