. Observe: <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/SjxR9J3\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/SjxR9J3</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I really like both of them but I prefer the second one","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T12:38:43-08:00","id":1498566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Adrasalieth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1498506-phrases-for-the-exarchs?p=1498528#post1498528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, asking the right Ochem- ahem I mean using Midjourney works a bit better. Observe: <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/SjxR9J3\" target=\"_blank\">https://imgur.com/a/SjxR9J3</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, this is nice <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T13:17:34-08:00","id":1498572,"title":"","content":"Unity: Divide and Conquer. Unite and Conquer. There's always someone to conquer.<br /> Father: Thou shalt have no other gods before me, for the kingdom of heaven is mine.<br /> General: All the world is who you can kill and how you can politely inform them of that. Mind you, sometimes the politest way is the most direct.<br /> Eye: You are who you are when you <i>think</i> no one's looking. Big difference.<br /> Ruin: &quot;I get knocked down, just to get up again&quot; until your alcoholism kills you, but by all means, keep singing.<br /> Prophet: It's never you, by the way. Even when we tell you otherwise, it's never really you.<br /> Psychopomp: Death is a toll booth, time is the excuse for price inflation.<br /> Chancellor: Everything has a price-the same price, in the end, always more than anyone is worth.<br /> Raptor: The only reason to not be the predator is when you're unfailingly the prey.<br /> Nemesis: Everyone wants to see you fail. The question is which night'll have that for entertainment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 12-01-2022, 04:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T14:19:40-08:00","id":1498576,"title":"","content":"<b>Raptor:</b> &quot;Slaughter your rivals or become a feast at their table&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Prophet:</b> &quot;Choice is irrelevant when I decide the options&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>General:</b> &quot;War is the slow amputation of your humanity&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Eye:</b> &quot;When all is laid bare, nothing you care about is safe&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Unity:</b> &quot;No solace in loneliness, no self in the crowd&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Father:</b> &quot;Uncompromising zeal is the only anchor to reality&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Ruin:</b> &quot;Where entropy ends, calamity springs eternal&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Nemesis:</b> &quot;Only eyes wide shut can hide you from the unknown&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Chancellor:</b> &quot;Everything has a price, nothing has value&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Psychopomp:</b> &quot;Judgement starts where entropy begins&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Gate:</b> &quot;The impossibility shaped hole in the world marches to silence itself shut&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 12-01-2022, 05:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T18:53:48-08:00","id":1498589,"title":"","content":"The Father: I am the Way and the Truth and the Life. Let all know only the Lie I've made for them.<br /> <br /> The general: the smell of flesh burning itself is not as delectable as the learned inhumanity to cope with it<br /> <br /> The Chancellor: you are worth nothing but the things you own. Yes. You are less than those very things, too.<br /> <br /> The Nemesis: no Ministry of my own is needed, for a comforting Lie is enough to secure my station.<br /> <br /> The Raptor: Spread your seed how you wish. Sate your hunger. Hurt those that hurt you. There is no higher self. Only a body that wants pleasure and safety and procreation <br /> <br /> The Psychopomp: of course there's a soul. And most are so ugly they will never pass through the gates I guard.<br /> <br /> The Eye: it's not whether I see you or not. It's whether you care that I do or not. <br /> <br /> All exarchs: The battle for heaven is already won.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T19:39:09-08:00","id":1498592,"title":"","content":"The Father: I absolve you of your sins. Know that what you do in my name is beyond reproach.<br /> <br /> The General: Relax. Remember, you're just following orders.<br /> <br /> The Eye: All eyes on me.<br /> <br /> The Nemesis: Avert your eyes. If you can't see it, it doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> The Psychopomp: Another life; another turn of the wheel. Despair not, perhaps your sin will not hobble your next try. (Side note, I like the idea of a Psychopomp cult that encourages everyone to act like they're video game characters with a quicksave.)<br /> <br /> As one:<b> We are what's left. We are what's right. We are the enemy. Ours are the hands that shall take you down, and bring you to your knees.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T20:41:59-08:00","id":1498596,"title":"","content":"The Exarchs as a whole:<br /> WE ARE THE WAY OF THE WORLD.<br /> WE ARE WHAT LIES IN YOUR HEARTS.<br /> WE ARE THE WHEEL THAT NEVER ENDS.<br /> WE ARE THE IRON LIE.<br /> WE ARE THE TRUTH.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27115-glorious-end","name":"Glorious End","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T21:20:24-08:00","id":1498603,"title":"","content":"The Nemesis: There are no monsters in the dark. Best you don't find out for yourself, though.<br /> <br /> The General: &quot;fight for your ideals. Fight for your country. Fight for your friends and loved ones. Fight&quot; and &quot;all is fair in war&quot;<br /> <br /> The Gate: Do not open the Gate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T00:38:19-08:00","id":1498607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1498506-phrases-for-the-exarchs?p=1498527#post1498527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So far I tried hotpot.ai and it flagged me as asking for an NSFW request for using the word Father. Rofl</div> </div> </div> </div>Had no trouble with pixelz dot ai, except the output was a little off: <a href=\"https://app.pixelz.ai/images/MJSBZV042ZK2HRN9_0\" target=\"_blank\">https://app.pixelz.ai/images/MJSBZV042ZK2HRN9_0</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T22:31:30-08:00","id":1499033,"title":"","content":"<u><b>What Repeats Eternally In The Minds Of Those Who Think They'll Always Win</b></u><br /> <br /> General: &quot;They'll Hurt Me So I'll Hurt Them So They'll Hurt Me So I'll Hurt Them&quot;<br /> <br /> Chancellor: &quot;I Need Money So I Can Be Important But To Be Important I Need Money&quot;<br /> <br /> Father: &quot;You Believe In Me Because I Know What's Right And I Know What's Right Because You Believe In Me&quot;<br /> <br /> Raptor: &quot;You Must Remain The Predator So You Can Stop Thinking About Your Prey So You Can Remain The Predator&quot;<br /> <br /> Unity: &quot;You Want To Fit In To Not Be Alone Because Being Alone Makes You Want To Fit In&quot;<br /> <br /> Eye: &quot;They Are Conspiring Against You So You Must Betray Them Because They're Conspiring Against You&quot;<br /> <br /> Nemesis: &quot;It's Dangerous Because You Can't Understand It And You Can't Understand It Because It's Dangerous&quot;<br /> <br /> Psychopomp: &quot;You Didn't Enter Paradise Because You're Not Good Enough Because You Didn't Enter Paradise&quot;<br /> <br /> Prophet: &quot;Your Choices Don't Matter Because You're Too Small Because Your Choices Don't Matter&quot;<br /> <br /> Ruin: &quot;Nothing Will Work Because Everything Is Doomed To Fail Because Nothing Will Work&quot;<br /> <br /> Gate: &quot;The Truth Doesn't Matter.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}